<p>
After some breakfast I hit the road.  The park is just a little ways away, I should be there in no time at all.  You know, I've never been to <a href="javascript:myPopup1('http://www.infoplease.com/ce6/us/A0827413.html')">Kentucky</a> before.  Arriving two days earlier under the cover of night, I wasn't able to see any of its scenery.  Today is my first glimpse of the State.  In the central part of the State, where I am now, the geography is rather flat and lackluster.
<p>
