<p>
Nicknamed the Bluegrass State, Kentucky is the 15th State admitted into the Union.  Did you know that more than 4 million folks live here?  I wonder, how many of them know that their State motto is "United we stand, divided we fall", their State bird is the cardinal, their State flower is goldenrod, and their State tree is the coffee tree.  I live in Oregon and can never remember my State's designated particulars.  I suspect most people just don't care.  So, within 30 seconds of reading this, and even if you live in Kentucky, you will have forgotten Kentucky's particulars too.
<p>
