<p>
When I think of Kentucky, I think of Bourbon whiskey, thoroughbred racehorses, and tobacco.  After my little drive today, I'll need to add another to my list, namely, "uninteresting scenery at its central core."  God, this part of Kentucky is really boring, Mammoth Cave National Park can't come to soon for me.  Given the location of the park, apparently this part of Kentucky looks better underground!
